  "body": "Thanks for testing this on macOS arm64 and for the extra task-attribute checks.\n\nI agree the terminal-observation problem is separate. It's already on the base revision, and it changes what `return_episode_data` records rather than whether the async workers survive. So I'd keep it out of this PR. I didn't find an existing issue for it. Since you have the fixture and the patch, it would make a good issue/PR of its own, and I'm happy to test it on the Jetson Thor once it's up.\n\n(Reply drafted with AI assistance.)\n",
